        "ai_rubric": {
          "Calculus Process": "Finds $\\frac{dy}{dx} = 8(3-2x)^{-3} - 1$ (B2). Finds $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2} = 48(3-2x)^{-4}$ (B1). Finds $\\int y\\,dx = \\frac{1}{3-2x} - \\frac{1}{2}x^2 + c$ (B3)."
        },
